{
  "uid": "tasky-overview",
  "title": "Tasky Overview",
  "description": "Phase 1 launch baseline dashboard — service health, API performance, authentication, and business metric placeholders.",
  "timezone": "utc",
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "Prometheus"
        },
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Service Health",
      "type": "row",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Up Status",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "up{job=\"tasky-api\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{ instance }}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": { "text": "DOWN", "color": "red" },
                "1": { "text": "UP", "color": "green" }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "value": null, "color": "red" },
              { "value": 1, "color": "green" }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "JVM Memory Used",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "jvm_memory_used_bytes",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{ area }} — {{ id }}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 10, "x": 4, "y": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "HTTP Request Rate",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count[5m])",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{ method }} {{ uri }} {{ status }}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 10, "x": 14, "y": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "API Performance",
      "type": "row",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 9 }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Request Duration p95",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le, uri))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{ uri }}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 14, "x": 0, "y": 10 }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "5xx Error Rate",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{status=~\"5..\"}[15m])) / sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count[15m])) * 100",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "value": null, "color": "green" },
              { "value": 1, "color": "yellow" },
              { "value": 5, "color": "red" }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 10, "x": 14, "y": 10 }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "title": "Authentication",
      "type": "row",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 18 }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "title": "Auth Request Rate",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{uri=~\"/api/v1/auth/.*\"}[5m])",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{ method }} {{ uri }} {{ status }}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 14, "x": 0, "y": 19 }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "title": "Circuit Breaker State",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "resilience4j_circuitbreaker_state",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{ name }}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": { "text": "CLOSED", "color": "green" },
                "1": { "text": "OPEN", "color": "red" },
                "2": { "text": "HALF_OPEN", "color": "yellow" }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "description": "Shows resilience4j circuit breaker states. Panel displays data only when the resilience4j CircuitBreaker metrics are exported by the application.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 10, "x": 14, "y": 19 }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "title": "Business Metrics",
      "type": "row",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 27 }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "title": "Business Metrics — Placeholders",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 28 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Business KPI Panels\n\nThese panels will be populated once the event metrics pipeline is wired to Prometheus.\n\nRefer to `docs/METRICS.md` sections 11–12 for KPI definitions and alert thresholds.\n\n### Required custom metrics\n\n| Metric | PromQL pattern | Description |\n|--------|---------------|-------------|\n| Category Liquidity Score | `tasky_category_liquidity_score` | % tasks with qualified application within 24h |\n| Task-to-Booking Conversion | `tasky_task_to_booking_conversion_28d` | 28-day conversion rate |\n| Booking Completion Rate | `tasky_booking_completion_rate_28d` | 28-day completion rate |\n| Review Completion Rate | `tasky_review_completion_rate_28d` | 28-day review rate |\n| Verification Turnaround | `tasky_verification_turnaway_median_seconds` | Median verification queue time |\n| Dispute Resolution Time | `tasky_dispute_resolution_median_seconds` | Median dispute resolution time |\n| Repeat Booking Rate | `tasky_repeat_booking_rate` | Weekly repeat customer rate |\n\n### How to wire\n\n1. Add a scheduled job in the Spring Boot app that aggregates from the `events` table and exports as Prometheus gauges.\n2. Replace this text panel with individual stat/timeseries panels per metric.\n3. Uncomment the corresponding alert rules in `tooling/observability/prometheus/alerts/tasky-alerts.yml`.\n"
      }
    }
  ]
}
